              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kepha uJesu wababizela kuye, wathi: “Niyazi ukuthi ababusi bezizwe babusa phezu kwazo, nezikhulu zazo ziphethe amandla phezu kwazo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
